{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/banner.png?t=1749571495\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a high-octane, old-school styled shoot \u2019em up (SHMUP) that pushes your reflexes and strategy to the breaking point. Designed in the spirit of 1980s arcade classics, it\u2019s not for the faint of heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into five brutally challenging levels, arm yourself with 28 deadly weapons, and uncover a web of hidden secrets and bonus stages. Every run demands precision, pattern-reading and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/skull.gif?t=1749571495\" /></div>\u00a0<strong>Five Brutal Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through uniquely themed stages, each ramping up the difficulty and crowding the screen with relentless enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/skull.gif?t=1749571495\" /></div>\u00a0<strong>28 Distinct Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From rapid-fire blasters to devastating lasers\u2014mix and upgrade your loadout to suit any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/skull.gif?t=1749571495\" /></div>\u00a0<strong>Hidden Secrets &amp; Bonus Paths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every nook and cranny to unlock secret areas, challenge rooms and alternate endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/skull.gif?t=1749571495\" /></div>\u00a0<strong>Authentic 1980s Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel-perfect visuals, CRT filter and sprite-based explosions evoke the golden era of arcade shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/skull.gif?t=1749571495\" /></div>\u00a0<strong>Chiptune-Driven Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pounding, synth-heavy score that ramps up the tension and nostalgia with every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/skull.gif?t=1749571495\" /></div><strong>Extreme Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master score attack modes and conquer the leaderboard for the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No checkpoints. No mercy. Just you, your ship and a hailstorm of bullets. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready to test your mettle in ZAXTRON EXPLUS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/TitleZaxtron.png?t=1749571495\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806110/extras/Flowe